From: helmfile-enhancement-plan
Subject: [PATCH] PR-T-07 — Conftest/OPA policy tests for HF-13 / HF-15 / HF-05

Closes G7 (no policy tests).
Branch: ci/conftest-policy-tests
Depends-on: PR-T-01

Adds three Rego policies + one test fixture. After PR-HF-05/13/15 land,
the `conftest test` step in CI must exit 0; before they land it returns
the matching `deny` messages so we can track progress.

