+| File | Annotation key | Rule suppressed | Rationale | Ticket |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| (example) `temporal-namespace-register-job.yaml` | `OPA-EXEMPT: no_latest_tag` | `no_latest_tag.rego` | bootstrap admin-tools image; tracked in HF-13 follow-up | HF-13 |
